             33  *       EXECUTE FOR COMMAND.  WHEN A FOR
             34  *       STATEMENT IS EXECUTED, THE FOR/NEXT
             35  *       STACK (FNS) IS SEARCHED FOR A ZERO
             36  *       ENTRY.  DURING THE SEARCH, IF
             37  *       AN IDENTICAL ENTRY IS FOUND, IT IS
             38  *       DELETED AND THE STACK IS ROLLED DOWN.
             39  *
             40  *       A PRE-TEST IS MADE TO SEE IF THE
             41  *       CONDITION IS MET IN WHICH CASE, THE
             42  *       FOR COMMAND WILL SEARCH FOR A MATCHING
             43  *       NEXT.
             44  *
             45  *       THE FOR/NEXT STACK FORMAT IS:
             46  *
             47  *       !    '    '    '    '    '    '    '    '    !
             48  *         VAR -----STEP----- ------TO------ PBC  PLC
             49  *
             50  *       VAR = 0 INDICATES EMPTY SLOT
             51  *
             52  * CALLING SEQUENCE:
             53  *
             54  *       B @FORY
             55  *
             56  *       EXIT TO NLIN
             57  * EXCEPTIONS AND CONDITIONS:
             58  *
             59  *       FOR W/O NEXT, STACK OVERFLOW
             60  *       EVALUATION ERRORS
             61  *       STORAGE OVERFLOW, ILLEGAL DELIMITER
             62  *       EXPECTING SIMPLE VARIABLE
ASM990 2.4.6     FOR                        Sun Aug 10 23:07:33 2025 Page 0003
