            177  *       PROCESS THE FOOT OF A FOR/NEXT LOOP.
            178  *
            179  *       NEXT SEARCHS THE FOR/NEXT STACK (FNS)
            180  *       FOR A MATCHING SIMPLE VARIABLE.  THE
            181  *       STEP IS ADDED TO THE VARIABLE AND
            182  *       A COMPLETION CHECK IS MADE.  IF LESS
            183  *       THAN OR EQUAL, IT LOOPS BACK.  OTHERWISE,
            184  *       THE STACK VARIBLE IS SET TO ZERO,
            185  *       AND PROGRAM EXECUTION CONTINUES AFTER
            186  *       THE NEXT STATEMENT.
            187  *
            188  * CALLING SEQUENCE:
            189  *
            190  *       B @NXTY
            191  *
            192  *       EXIT TO NLIN
            193  *
            194  * EXCEPTIONS AND CONDITIONS:
            195  *
            196  *       EVALUATION ERRORS
            197  *       NEXT W/O FOR
            198  *
